    "text": "We naively think that the people from the third-world are just like us. They are absolutely not. Their societies are dog eat dog hellholes where no one respects anyone else. Cruelty, violence (including the sexual violence), and fraud are a norm. Even those of them who are educated, live by the same standards and values. Many of those people are barbarians by all of the accepted Western standards.\nThey bring all of that into our own societies with them, and by importing the third-world, we are well on the way to become the third-world ourselves. Now some of these savages are in our government, trying to enshrine their savagery into our legislative process.",
